   <subsection xml:id="LOs-1-7">
    <title>Learning Objectives Review</title>
    <p>After this lesson, you should be able to:</p>
    <remark>
      <title>1.7.A</title>
      <p>Develop code using mathematical expressions, and determine the result of these expressions.</p>
    </remark>

    <remark>
      <title>1.7.B</title>
      <p>Develop code to generate random numbers, and determine the possible values that could be
        produced as a result.</p>
    </remark>
